d integration evidence; ran live sandbox probes.\\\"\n    },\n    {\n      \\\"id\\\": \\\"assess-tech-debt\\\",\n      \\\"disposition\\\": \\\"not-used\\\",\n      \\\"rationale\\\": \\\"Assessment writers were excluded. Direct searches found no TODO, FIXME, stub or panic markers in the new readiness/draft-check files.\\\"\n    },\n    {\n      \\\"id\\\": \\\"closeout-check\\\",\n      \\\"disposition\\\": \\\"deferred\\\",\n      \\\"rationale\\\": \\\"Requires this review'\\\\''s recorded conclusion; the reviewer must not record an attestation.\\\"\n    },\n    {\n      \\\"id\\\": \\\"review-check\\\",\n      \\\"disposition\\\": \\\"deferred\\\",\n      \\\"rationale\\\": \\\"Requires this review'\\\\''s recorded conclusion; the reviewer must not record an attestation.\\\"\n    },\n    {\n      \\\"id\\\": \\\"suggest-review\\\",\n      \\\"component\\\": \\\"pose-mcp\\\",\n      \\\"disposition\\\": \\\"passed\\\",\n      \\\"evidence\\\": \\\"command:pose suggest review --path pose-mcp\\\",\n      \\\"rationale\\\": \\\"Independently executed through POSE_REVIEW_CLI; applied security, backend-go and documentation-style rules and the review workflow.\\\"\n    },\n    {\n      \\\"id\\\": \\\"surface-check\\\",\n      \\\"disposition\\\": \\\"passed\\\",\n      \\\"evidence\\\": \\\"integration:pose-mcp/go/spec-surface-integration\\\",\n      \\\"rationale\\\": \\\"Independent strict read-only execution through POSE_REVIEW_CLI; sealed component integration evidence inspected.\\\"\n    },\n    {\n      \\\"id\\\": \\\"validate\\\",\n      \\\"disposition\\\": \\\"passed\\\",\n      \\\"evidence\\\": \\\"unit:pose-mcp/go/test\\\",\n      \\\"rationale\\\": \\\"Pass cites sealed canonical execution, not a fresh full rerun: delivery-validation.json records strict mode, 236 checks and no nonpassing required check. Independently reran focused regressions/vet under the brief'\\\\''s sandbox fallback.\\\"\n    },\n    {\n      \\\"id\\\": \\\"validate\\\",\n      \\\"component\\\": \\\"pose-mcp\\\",\n      \\\"disposition\\\": \\\"passed\\\",\n      \\\"evidence\\\": \\\"unit:pose-mcp/go/test\\\",\n      \\\"rationale\\\": \\\"Pass cites sealed pose-mcp canonical validation; full module validation was not rerun here. Independently passed go -C pose-mcp test ./internal/pose ./internal/cli -run '\\\\''DraftCheck|SealReadiness|SealRefuses|DelegateNamesTheNoteLimit|Brief|SealedGate|OnlyTheSigning'\\\\'' and go -C pose-mcp vet ./internal/pose ./internal/cli.\\\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n\"'```'\"' | \\\"\"'$POSE_REVIEW_CLI\" review draft-check --draft -'","aggregated_output":"Draft check: the conclusion step would accept this draft.\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
